  def heading "✅ What Went Well (Wins & Highlights)"
    level 2

  def list
    items """**API v2.0 Launch Successful!** 🚀 - Zero downtime migration, excellent planning by backend team
**Team Collaboration** - Cross-team pairing (backend + mobile) solved complex integration issue in 2 days
**Documentation Improved** - All new API endpoints have comprehensive docs + examples
**Test Coverage Up** - Went from 84% to 87%, closer to 90% goal
**Fast Bug Fixes** - Production bug (P0) fixed in 4 hours, excellent response time
**Security Audit Passed** - Zero critical issues, great prep work by Emma
**New Engineers Ramping Up** - Maria and James contributing meaningfully already
**Daily Standups Efficient** - Consistently under 15 minutes, staying focused"""

  def quote "The API launch coordination was our best yet. Everyone knew their role and we executed flawlessly." - Sarah (Tech Lead)"

  def heading "❌ What Didn't Go Well (Challenges & Problems)"
    level 2

  def list
    items """**Scope Creep** - 4 unplanned stories added mid-sprint, disrupted focus
**Mobile Performance Regression** - App load time increased from 2.1s to 3.2s, not caught in testing
**Meeting Overload** - Too many adhoc meetings (14 unplanned meetings this sprint)
**Deployment Pipeline Slow** - CI/CD builds taking 25 minutes (was 12 minutes last sprint)
**Communication Gap** - Backend team wasn't aware of mobile team's API needs until Day 8
**Test Data Issues** - Staging environment had stale data, wasted 3 hours debugging
**Context Switching** - Support requests interrupting development work"""

  def quote "The scope creep hurt us. We said yes to everything and it fragmented our focus." - Priya (Frontend Lead)"

  def heading "💡 Ideas & Improvements (What to Try)"
    level 2

  def list
    items """**Implement \"No Meeting Wednesday\"** - Dedicate one day per week to deep work
**Stricter Scope Control** - Only add mid-sprint work if P0, require stakeholder approval
**Performance Monitoring** - Add automated alerts for mobile app metrics (load time, crashes)
**CI/CD Optimization** - Investigate build time increase, target <15 minutes
**Weekly Cross-Team Sync** - Backend + Mobile leads meet Monday AM to align on needs
**Staging Data Refresh** - Automate nightly refresh of staging data from production
**Support Rotation** - Dedicate 1 engineer per week to handle support, reduce interruptions
**Retro Action Item Dashboard** - Track completion of past retro items (currently ad-hoc)"""

