  def heading "🙏 Appreciation & Shoutouts"
    level 2

  def list
    items """**Backend Team (Sarah, David, Carlos)** - API v2.0 launch was textbook perfect. Planning, communication, execution all excellent.
**Emma** - Security audit prep was thorough and professional. Caught issues before the auditors did.
**Priya** - Took on extra mentorship for James while delivering her sprint commitments. Great team player.
**Tom** - Stayed late Tuesday to fix production bug, saved us from major customer impact.
**Maria** - New engineer (week 2!) but already contributing meaningfully. Fast learner."""

  def heading "📝 Additional Notes"
    level 2

  def paragraph "Overall positive sprint despite velocity dip. API launch was a major milestone and team executed well under pressure. The performance regression is concerning but we have a plan to address it."

  def paragraph "Team morale is high (8.2/10) which is great. Meeting overload is the #1 complaint - \"No Meeting Wednesday\" should help significantly."

  def paragraph "Action items from Sprint 25 retro: 3/5 completed, 2 carried over (documentation templates, test automation). Need better tracking system (action item #7)."

